{
  "work_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_john_kalybites",
  "source_path": "coptic-scriptorium/life_john_kalybites.json",
  "source_language": "cop",
  "target_language": "eng",
  "provenance": {
    "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12": {
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol",
      "prompt_version": "bulk-2026-10-12",
      "date": "2026-10-12",
      "script": "scripts.embed_eval.translate"
    }
  },
  "translations": [
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_john_kalybites#CopScr.life-john-kalybites.000.0021",
      "source_sha256": "596c9e1c196e3256",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "And do not go to your monastery and leave me behind, for I hide nothing from you about my whole life. My parents love me very much, more than my brothers."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_john_kalybites#CopScr.life-john-kalybites.000.0022",
      "source_sha256": "2bcd14cf98e5fa3d",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "Indeed, they entrusted me to teachers."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_john_kalybites#CopScr.life-john-kalybites.000.0040",
      "source_sha256": "309cb5f45d819d10",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "At that moment his father gave orders."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_john_kalybites#CopScr.life-john-kalybites.000.0045",
      "source_sha256": "3ed2228503fda0e6",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "And he was receiving instruction there with great sorrow."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_john_kalybites#CopScr.life-john-kalybites.000.0048",
      "source_sha256": "08962ece68e02f85",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "When John saw the brother who was a monk, he was very glad and rejoiced. He greeted him with great joy."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_john_kalybites#CopScr.life-john-kalybites.000.0080",
      "source_sha256": "2c0560f4806668b0",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "Please let him stay with you while I go to my friends and ask them when they are coming to me."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_john_kalybites#CopScr.life-john-kalybites.000.0081",
      "source_sha256": "802dace09cf051d9",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "Then the old monk understood that he was speaking to him about the ship’s captain."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_john_kalybites#CopScr.life-john-kalybites.000.0082",
      "source_sha256": "61919060e71f2c8d",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "But he had wanted to mislead him because of the servant who was accompanying him."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_john_kalybites#CopScr.life-john-kalybites.000.0083",
      "source_sha256": "4e9d73e4c5bbb33d",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "John took the hundred gold coins and went to the chief captain of the ship."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_john_kalybites#CopScr.life-john-kalybites.000.0084",
      "source_sha256": "88a58851180344b1",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "He said to him, “I beg you, my lord and brother, to prepare the ship so that we can leave quickly, my brother and I.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_john_kalybites#CopScr.life-john-kalybites.000.0141",
      "source_sha256": "80ef36eb5ae5782b",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "The abbot said to the young boy, “My son, look, I see that you are small in stature and very fine in your deeds.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_john_kalybites#CopScr.life-john-kalybites.000.0150",
      "source_sha256": "338116d8a3e2a4b7",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "For the hardship of abstinence makes a person even weaker."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_john_kalybites#CopScr.life-john-kalybites.001.0006",
      "source_sha256": "2e9a014aa7d9aad8",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "But you have become weak through this great deprivation."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_john_kalybites#CopScr.life-john-kalybites.001.0087",
      "source_sha256": "1d55f4c439663b1d",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "John would give whatever they sent him each day as charity to the poor and needy. He ate none of it except bread and salt."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_john_kalybites#CopScr.life-john-kalybites.001.0103",
      "source_sha256": "3c18320e2c77bd38",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "“I beg you, my lady: even if you despise me because I am a weak man, do this for me for God’s sake, and be so kind as to come to me here, for I have something to tell you.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_john_kalybites#CopScr.life-john-kalybites.001.0114",
      "source_sha256": "54da95558171cff7",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "“And [?] when I die.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_john_kalybites#CopScr.life-john-kalybites.001.0116",
      "source_sha256": "dfd89bf9bd6217d1",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "She said to her servants, “Go and bring him here to me.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_john_kalybites#CopScr.life-john-kalybites.001.0125",
      "source_sha256": "b61085e5294cf658",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "But he said to her, “First swear an oath to me.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_john_kalybites#CopScr.life-john-kalybites.001.0142",
      "source_sha256": "84fd1cf1057da912",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "For their hearts were troubled, and their tears were pouring onto the ground."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_john_kalybites#CopScr.life-john-kalybites.001.0143",
      "source_sha256": "9309706bd5f64f22",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "And they could not get up because of their abundant tears."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_john_kalybites#CopScr.life-john-kalybites.001.0144",
      "source_sha256": "bd03666006b99498",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "He said to them, “Have you not recognized who I am?”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_john_kalybites#CopScr.life-john-kalybites.001.0145",
      "source_sha256": "7ab1ec58ab65abec",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "They said to him, “How could we recognize you?”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_john_kalybites#CopScr.life-john-kalybites.001.0146",
      "source_sha256": "ab033e6d32f4766e",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "He said to them, “I am John, your son, and this golden Gospel book is the one I asked you for.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "coptic-scriptorium/life_john_kalybites#CopScr.life-john-kalybites.001.0176",
      "source_sha256": "785c24b6e803eced",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-12",
      "group_size": 24,
      "text": "I, the wretched sinner Victor, the least of deacons, son of the blessed [?], deacon, son of the blessed Eponychus, archdeacon of Saint Mercurius the great general, from Pollaton, wrote this book. Remember me, Lord, when you come into your kingdom. On day [?]."
    }
  ]
}
